* D0 physical entrance JTL; every stage has series 0-V branch-current sensors.
V_D0_JTL_IN_1 DOUT_D0 D0_JTL_IN_1 0
XJTL_D0_1 D0_JTL_IN_1 D0_JTL_OUT_1 D0_JTL
V_T1_LINK_D0 D0_JTL_OUT_1 T1_I_D0 0

* Selected Carry branches: canonical sJTL -> CB_0928 -> JOIN; array DOUT joins directly.
V_CBU_A_D1 DOUT_D1 CBU_JOIN_D1 0
V_CARRY_IN_D1 C_D0 CARRY_SJTL_IN_D1 0
XSJTL_CARRY_D1 CARRY_SJTL_IN_D1 CARRY_SJTL_OUT_D1 sJTL
